sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant App as app.js
    participant MW as Express Middleware
    participant Router as routes/posts.js or routes/users.js
    participant Controller as controllers/*.js
    participant Store as In-Memory Data Store
    participant Error as middleware/errorHandler.js

    Note over App: Server starts with app.listen(PORT)
    App->>App: Load Express app
    App->>MW: Add express.json() and request logger
    App->>Router: Register /api/posts and /api/users routes
    App->>App: Define / and /health endpoints
    App-->>Client: Server listening on port 3000

    Client->>App: GET /health
    App->>MW: Request enters middleware
    MW-->>App: Continue to route handling
    App-->>Client: HTTP 200 + { status: "UP" }

    Client->>App: POST /api/posts
    App->>MW: Parse JSON body
    MW-->>App: Continue
    App->>Router: Match /api/posts route
    Router->>Controller: createPost(req, res)
    Controller->>Controller: Validate title, content, author
    alt Valid payload
        Controller->>Store: Add new post object
        Store-->>Controller: Post stored successfully
        Controller-->>Client: HTTP 201 + created post
    else Invalid payload
        Controller-->>Client: HTTP 400 + validation error
    end

    Client->>App: GET /api/posts/:id
    App->>Router: Match post route
    Router->>Controller: getPostById(req, res)
    Controller->>Store: Find post by id
    Store-->>Controller: Post data or not found
    alt Post exists
        Controller-->>Client: HTTP 200 + post JSON
    else Not found
        Controller-->>Client: HTTP 404 + error message
    end

    Client->>App: PUT /api/posts/:id
    App->>Router: Match update route
    Router->>Controller: updatePost(req, res)
    Controller->>Controller: Validate incoming fields
    Controller->>Store: Update matching post
    Store-->>Controller: Updated post
    Controller-->>Client: HTTP 200 + updated post

    Client->>App: DELETE /api/posts/:id
    App->>Router: Match delete route
    Router->>Controller: deletePost(req, res)
    Controller->>Store: Remove matching post
    Store-->>Controller: Deleted post
    Controller-->>Client: HTTP 200 + delete confirmation

    Client->>App: POST /api/users
    App->>Router: Match /api/users route
    Router->>Controller: createUser(req, res)
    Controller->>Controller: Validate name/email/role
    alt Valid payload
        Controller->>Store: Add new user
        Store-->>Controller: User stored successfully
        Controller-->>Client: HTTP 201 + created user
    else Invalid payload
        Controller-->>Client: HTTP 400 + validation error
    end

    Client->>App: GET /api/users/:id
    App->>Router: Match user route
    Router->>Controller: getUserById(req, res)
    Controller->>Store: Find user by id
    Store-->>Controller: User data or not found
    Controller-->>Client: HTTP 200 or 404 response

    Note over App,Error: Any unhandled exception or thrown error is sent to the centralized error middleware
    App->>Error: err, req, res, next
    Error-->>Client: Standardized JSON error response

    Client->>App: GET /unknown-route
    App->>App: Route not found middleware
    App-->>Client: HTTP 404 + available routes
